## Documentation contract

A task is **not complete** until the docs decision is stated in the final report: **new ADR**, **update existing docs**, or **none** — with a one-line reason. Use `/wrap-up` to close out substantial tasks.

| Change | Register as |
| --- | --- |
| New/changed domain rule, invariant, API contract shape, data ownership, infra topology, security boundary | **New ADR** in `docs/adr/` (use `/adr`) |
| Reversing or amending a previous decision | **New ADR** superseding the old one (never edit the old one's meaning) |
| Behavior described in existing docs/runbooks changes | **Update those docs** in the same change |
| Investigation or audit | **Report** in `docs/audit/` (evidence first, fixes after triage) |
| Mechanical refactor, copy fix, dependency bump | **None** — say so explicitly |
